---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Solutions for Working Parents | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Discover how Marietta Childcare supports working parents with full-time care, flexible scheduling, and convenient location.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/parent_dropoff_hug_doorway_background.jpg" 
        alt="Parent and child" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Childcare Solutions for Working Parents</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Full-time care, flexible scheduling, and convenient location to support your professional commitments.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Full-Time Care Options</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers full-time care for working parents. Full-time care at Marietta Childcare operates Monday through Friday from 6:30 AM to 6:30 PM. Marietta Childcare's extended hours accommodate typical work schedules and commute times.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's full-time programs provide consistent, reliable care. Full-time enrollment at Marietta Childcare ensures your child has a stable learning environment. Marietta Childcare's full-time approach supports children's development and parent peace of mind.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Flexible Scheduling</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare recognizes that working parents have diverse schedules. Flexible scheduling at Marietta Childcare accommodates various work arrangements. Marietta Childcare's flexible options support parents with non-traditional hours.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's scheduling flexibility reduces parent stress about childcare logistics. Flexible care at Marietta Childcare allows parents to focus on work responsibilities. Marietta Childcare's adaptable approach supports working parent success.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Convenient Location and Pickup Services</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's location at 2040 MacLand Crossing Circle in Marietta provides convenient access. Marietta Childcare's location is centrally positioned for working parents. Marietta Childcare's facility is easily accessible from major roads and workplaces.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides after school pickup services from local elementary schools. Pickup locations at Marietta Childcare include Dowell Elementary, Hollydale Elementary, and Cheatham Hill Elementary. Marietta Childcare's transportation service eliminates separate pickup logistics for working parents.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Before and After School Care</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides before and after school care for school-age children. Before school care at Marietta Childcare begins at 6:30 AM for early work starts. After school care at Marietta Childcare operates until 6:30 PM for extended work hours.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's before and after school programs include homework support and activities. Care at Marietta Childcare provides safe supervision during non-school hours. Marietta Childcare's school-age programs support working parents with school-age children.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Summer Care Solutions</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers summer camp programs for working parents. Summer camp at Marietta Childcare provides full-day programming during school breaks. Marietta Childcare's summer programs include activities, field trips, and enrichment.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's summer care eliminates childcare gaps for working parents. Summer programs at Marietta Childcare keep children engaged and learning. Marietta Childcare's summer solutions support parent work continuity.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Peace of Mind and Communication</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides daily updates and communication for working parents. Daily reports at Marietta Childcare include photos and information about children's activities. Marietta Childcare's communication keeps working parents connected throughout the day.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's digital communication tools allow parents to stay informed. Communication at Marietta Childcare provides peace of mind about children's well-being. Marietta Childcare's transparent communication supports working parent confidence.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Quality Education and Development</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides quality education while parents work. Marietta Childcare's curriculum supports children's cognitive, social, and emotional development. Quality programming at Marietta Childcare ensures children thrive during work hours.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's educational approach prepares children for kindergarten and beyond. Marietta Childcare's teachers implement research-based practices. Marietta Childcare's commitment to quality supports children's long-term success.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Support for Working Parent Challenges</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare understands working parent challenges and provides support. Marietta Childcare's flexible policies accommodate unexpected work situations. Marietta Childcare's staff works with parents to address scheduling conflicts.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's supportive approach reduces working parent stress. Marietta Childcare recognizes the demands of balancing work and family. Marietta Childcare's commitment to working parents extends beyond childcare services.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Support Your Work-Life Balance</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare is committed to supporting working parents. Contact Marietta Childcare to learn how Marietta Childcare can provide the childcare solution your family needs.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/hours-and-schedule" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What Are Your Hours?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/single-parents" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Support for Single Parents</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/parent-communication" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Do You Communicate with Parents?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
